---
import ChartScale from './ChartScale.astro';
---
<section id="accounts-view" class="view" hidden>
  <header class="page-heading account-page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">04 / ACCOUNTS & BALANCES</p><h1>Know where you stand.</h1><p class="subtitle">Your total, your account mix, and the values you have recorded over time.</p></div><div class="account-page-controls"><ChartScale id="accounts-scale" /><button id="add-account" class="outline-button">+ Add account</button></div></header>
  <article class="card account-total-card" aria-labelledby="account-total-title">
    <div class="account-total-main">
      <p class="eyebrow">ACROSS YOUR ACCOUNTS</p>
      <h2 id="account-total-title">Total recorded value</h2>
      <p id="account-total" class="account-total-value">—</p>
      <p id="account-total-note" class="account-total-note"></p>
      <p id="account-total-dates" class="account-total-dates"></p>
    </div>
    <dl id="account-total-details" class="account-total-details"></dl>
  </article>
  <div id="account-summary" class="metrics account-summary"></div>
  <div class="account-insights-grid">
    <article class="card account-insight-card" aria-labelledby="account-allocation-title">
      <div class="card-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE BREAKDOWN</p><h2 id="account-allocation-title">Where your money sits</h2></div></div>
      <label class="account-chart-control" for="account-breakdown-group">Group accounts by<select id="account-breakdown-group" aria-controls="account-allocation" aria-describedby="account-allocation-note"><option value="role">Use in forecast</option><option value="type">Account type</option><option value="institution">Bank or platform</option><option value="account">Individual accounts</option></select></label>
      <div id="account-allocation" class="account-allocation"></div>
      <p id="account-allocation-note" class="chart-note"></p>
    </article>
    <article class="card account-insight-card" aria-labelledby="account-history-title">
      <div class="card-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR OBSERVATIONS</p><h2 id="account-history-title">Recorded value over time</h2></div></div>
      <label class="account-chart-control" for="account-history-account">Account<select id="account-history-account" aria-controls="account-history-chart" aria-describedby="account-history-note"></select></label>
      <dl id="account-history-change" class="account-history-change"></dl>
      <div id="account-history-chart" class="chart account-history-chart"></div>
      <p id="account-history-note" class="chart-note">Recorded observations only. Values between observations are not inferred from transactions.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
  <article class="review-banner"><div><strong id="account-readiness">Set your account balances to build a starting point.</strong><p>Imported transactions do not establish opening or current balances. Blank means unknown; zero is a real balance. Investment values stay separate from cash and reserves. Each observation keeps its own date.</p></div><button id="use-account-balances" class="outline-button">Use balances for forecast →</button></article>
  <div id="account-cards" class="accounts-grid"></div>
  <article class="card endpoint-directory" aria-labelledby="endpoint-directory-title">
    <div class="card-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">EVERY SIDE OF A PAYMENT</p><h2 id="endpoint-directory-title">All senders &amp; receivers</h2></div><span id="endpoint-directory-count" class="muted small" role="status" aria-live="polite"></span></div>
    <p class="input-note">Explore your own accounts and external senders or receivers recorded in the ledger. Labels are supplied by your imports; unknown identities stay unknown.</p>
    <div class="endpoint-filters">
      <label>Search accounts and identities<input id="endpoint-search-directory" type="search" placeholder="Search a name or account label…" aria-controls="endpoint-directory-list" /></label>
      <label>Show<select id="endpoint-directory-scope" aria-controls="endpoint-directory-list"><option value="all">All identities</option><option value="owned">My accounts</option><option value="external">External senders &amp; receivers</option></select></label>
    </div>
    <p id="endpoint-directory-status" class="detail-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    <div id="endpoint-directory-list" class="endpoint-directory-list"></div>
    <div class="pagination">
      <span id="endpoint-directory-page-label" class="muted small"></span>
      <div><button id="endpoint-directory-previous" type="button" class="outline-button" disabled>← Previous</button><button id="endpoint-directory-next" type="button" class="outline-button" disabled>Next →</button></div>
    </div>
  </article>
</section>
